# Berean Standard Bible — Public Domain (CC0 1.0 Universal)

The Berean Standard Bible (BSB) text in this repository is **officially dedicated to
the public domain** as of April 30, 2023 by the Berean Bible Translation Committee,
in cooperation with Bible Hub, Discovery Bible, and OpenBible.com. All uses are freely
permitted, including commercial reproduction and adaptation, with no license required.

Official terms: https://berean.bible/terms.htm

> "The Berean Bible and Majority Bible texts are officially dedicated to the public
> domain as of April 30, 2023. All uses are freely permitted."

## Attribution (appreciated but not required)

The Holy Bible, Berean Standard Bible (BSB), produced in cooperation with Bible Hub,
Discovery Bible, OpenBible.com, and the Berean Bible Translation Committee. This text
of God's Word has been dedicated to the public domain.

## Note on derivatives

For derivative works that vary from the official text, the publisher respectfully
requests that the "Berean" name not be used. Applications maintaining the verbatim
official text are invited to bear the Berean name.

---
This file replaces a prior incorrect CC BY-SA 4.0 notice that also misattributed the
text to the Lockman Foundation. The BSB is public domain (CC0); the Lockman Foundation
publishes the NASB/LSB, not the BSB. Correction verified against berean.bible/terms.htm
and bereanbible.com/bsb.pdf (November 20, 2026).
